WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000 line:100%,end
Admin opens People and devices.
The list shows the company’s people.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:18.000 line:100%,end
Invite user is the form on the page.
Email is required. The role is chosen from the list.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:27.000 line:100%,end
Role Admin.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:36.000 line:100%,end
Role Maintenance.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:45.000 line:100%,end
Role Driver.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:54.000 line:100%,end
The invite has been sent. The person is not a member yet.
They open the link from the email.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:03.000 line:100%,end
Opening the invite link accepts the invite.
The person reaches the view for their own role.
